## Goal

The goal of this lab is to practice the basic configuration of Apache were I 
will aim to serve a HTTP webpage and query it from another machine.

Why HTTP? because I want the lab to later fit into other applications were I
can practice reading the clear text of the packages across the network.


## Scripts
- Install Apache
- Remove Apache
- Curl Configure

